# A loop keeps the VOX sound it was recorded with. A note recorded with GLASS (held round the whole loop,
# so it sounds all the way round) loops as GLASS after REED is picked; the hands then play REED over it,
# both sounding at once; a layer recorded with REED loops as REED beside the first, whichever sound is in
# hand (that layer's note is held for most of the loop: longer than the loop, it would end just after it
# began). PRESET: the loop still follows the scene's key, each layer its own sound.
wait 1000
expect vcur 1
tap REC
key w2 down
wait 2600
tap REC
wait 100
key w2 up
expect looper 2
tapkey b8
wait 100
expect vcur 2
wait 3000
expect vox_sounds 1
key w5 down
wait 300
expect vox_sounds 3
key w5 up
wait 300
expect vox_sounds 1
tap REC
key w6 down
wait 2500
key w6 up
wait 300
tap REC
wait 100
expect layers 2
tapkey b7
wait 100
expect vcur 1
wait 3000
expect vox_sounds 3
tapkey b10
wait 3000
expect vcur 4
expect vox_sounds 3
turn PRESET 1
wait 13000
expect scene 2
expect vox_sounds 3
expect clips 0
